{
  "about": "docs/api/thread-search-v1.md, 'Words and keys'. `text` is a string, or {repeat, times, suffix?}: `repeat` written `times` times, then `suffix`. `words` lists every word of the text (the first 3000) with its start and end as UTF-16 code unit offsets and its key (null when it has none); a `key` may also be a {repeat, times}. A case with `wordCount` states the number of words and the key of the last.",
